    println("  ok")
    println("")
    println("ACCEPTANCE OK: Stage 54 -- std.tui (terminal UI primitives)")
    println("  Term (raw / restore / screen / clear / flush) -- ANSI escape sequences")
    println("  Cursor (move_to / up / down / left / right / hide / show / save / restore)")
    println("  Color (16-colour palette + bright + default + reset; bg conversion)")
    println("  Style (fg / bg / bold / dim / italic / underline / blink / reverse / hidden / strikethrough)")
    println("  Rect / Cell / Buffer (in-memory grid; pre-allocated; O(W*H) render)")
    println("  Widget convention: Text, Block, Paragraph (monomorphic helpers)")
    println("  Layout helpers: split_horizontal, split_vertical (weighted constraints)")
    println("  Pure-HLS implementation (no new compiler builtins; uses print() IO)")
    println("  Differential (interpreter == native) verified green.")
    return 0
